<section class="si-section"><div class="si-wrap"><div class="si-center"><h2>From Recommendations to Real Changes</h2><p>The Site Audit tells you where the opportunity is. Implementation is being designed to help carry those recommendations through to your website.</p></div><div class="si-cards"><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">Aa</span><h3>On-Page SEO Updates</h3><p>Implement approved titles, meta descriptions, headings, and other page-level improvements.</p></article><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">▦</span><h3>Product &amp; Category Optimization</h3><p>Apply approved SEO updates to supported ecommerce product and category pages.</p></article><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">↗</span><h3>Internal Linking</h3><p>Connect relevant pages so customers and search engines can navigate more effectively.</p></article><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">¶</span><h3>Content Improvements</h3><p>Apply approved updates where the site's platform and page structure safely support them.</p></article><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">◫</span><h3>Image SEO</h3><p>Update image alt text and other supported image-level fields.</p></article><article class="si-card"><span class="si-card-mark">✓</span><h3>Verification</h3><p>Confirm approved changes were applied successfully rather than assuming they worked.</p></article></div></div></section>
