<section class="si-section"><div class="si-wrap si-safety"><div><h2>You Stay in Control</h2><p>The current product design is centered around a careful, review-first workflow for supported websites and platforms.</p></div><div class="si-safety-items"><article class="si-safety-item"><h3>Review First</h3><p>Changes are intended to be reviewed and approved before they are applied.</p></article><article class="si-safety-item"><h3>Supported Changes Only</h3><p>Implementation should only make changes that can be handled safely on the site's supported platform and setup.</p></article><article class="si-safety-item"><h3>Verify After</h3><p>Updates should be checked after implementation so there is a record of what actually changed.</p></article></div></div></section>
